## Properties

### Data Model: Property
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///Users/vishnu/Workspace/Projects/Xperty/xperty-prototype/src/hooks/useAuth.jsx#5-110) | String | Unique Identifier |
| `address` | String | Line 1 of address |
| `city` | String | City name |
| `postcode` | String | UK Postcode |
| `propertyType` | String | Enum: `Residential Apartment`, `Residential House`, `HMO`, `Commercial Office`, `Commercial Retail` |
| `ownership` | String | Enum: `Freehold`, `Leasehold` |
| `bedrooms` | Integer | Number of bedrooms |
| `bathrooms` | Integer | Number of bathrooms |
| `status` | String | Enum: `Active`, `Draft`, `Archived` |
| `purchaseDate` | Date | Optional |
| `purchasePrice` | Number | Optional |
| `currentValue` | Number | Optional |
| `isSingleUnit` | Boolean | Default `true` |
| `units` | Integer | Number of units (if multi-unit) |
| `selectedAssets` | Array<String> | List of Asset IDs from Asset Library |
| `customAssets` | Array<Object> | List of custom assets `{ name, description }` |
| `documents` | Array<Object> | List of file objects |
| `complianceDocuments` | Array<Object> | List of compliance file objects |
| `assignee` | String | Email of assigned manager (optional) |

### List Properties
Get a list of all properties for the authenticated user.
- **Endpoint:** `GET /properties`
- **Query Params:**
  - `page`: Integer (default 1)
  - `limit`: Integer (default 10)
  - `status`: String (optional filter)
  - `search`: String (optional search by address/postcode)
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "prop_123",
        "address": "10 Downing Street",
        "city": "London",
        "postcode": "SW1A 1AA",
        "status": "Active",
        "propertyType": "Residential House",
        "bedrooms": 4,
        "bathrooms": 3,
        "currentValue": 5000000
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "total": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10
    }
  }
  ```

### Get Property Details
Get full details of a specific property.
- **Endpoint:** `GET /properties/:id`
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "id": "prop_123",
    "address": "10 Downing Street",
    "city": "London",
    "postcode": "SW1A 1AA",
    "propertyType": "Residential House",
    "ownership": "Freehold",
    "bedrooms": 4,
    "bathrooms": 3,
    "purchaseDate": "2020-01-01",
    "purchasePrice": 4500000,
    "currentValue": 5000000,
    "isSingleUnit": true,
    "units": 1,
    "status": "Active",
    "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "assignee": "manager@example.com",
    "selectedAssets": ["boiler-gas", "smoke-detector"],
    "customAssets": [
       { "id": "cust_1", "name": "Antique Chandelier", "value": 5000 }
    ],
    "documents": [
      { "id": "doc_1", "name": "Title Deed", "url": "...", "type": "application/pdf", "size": "2MB" }
    ],
    "complianceDocuments": [
      { "id": "comp_1", "name": "Gas Safety", "expiryDate": "2025-01-01", "url": "...", "type": "application/pdf" }
    ],
    "additionalUsers": [
      { "email": "partner@example.com", "role": "Manager" }
    ]
  }
  ```

### Create Property
Create a new property. Supports creating in `Draft` mode (minimal validation) or `Active` mode (full validation).
- **Endpoint:** `POST /properties`
- **Body:**
  ```json
  {
    "address": "10 Downing Street",
    "city": "London",
    "postcode": "SW1A 1AA",
    "propertyType": "Residential House",
    "ownership": "Freehold",
    "bedrooms": 4,
    "bathrooms": 3,
    "status": "Draft", // or "Active"
    "selectedAssets": ["boiler-gas"],
    // Optional: Create tenant during property creation
    "tenantDetails": {
        "name": "Alice Smith",
        "email": "alice@example.com",
        "leaseStart": "2024-01-01",
        "rentAmount": 1500
    }
  }
  ```
- **Response:** `201 Created`
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": { "id": "prop_124", ... }
  }
  ```

### Update Property
Update an existing property.
- **Endpoint:** `PUT /properties/:id`
- **Body:** (Partial object of fields to update)
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```

### Delete Property
- **Endpoint:** `DELETE /properties/:id`
- **Response:** `204 No Content`

