## Tenants

### Data Model: Tenant
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///Users/vishnu/Workspace/Projects/Xperty/xperty-prototype/src/hooks/useAuth.jsx#5-110) | String | Unique Identifier |
| `name` | String | Full Name |
| `email` | String | Email Address |
| `phone` | String | Phone Number |
| `propertyId` | String | ID of the property |
| `unit` | String | Unit name/number (if applicable) |
| `status` | String | Enum: `Active`, `Past`, `Prospective` |
| `rentAmount` | Number | Monthly Rent |
| `depositAmount` | Number | Security Deposit |
| `leaseStart` | Date | Lease Start Date |
| `leaseEnd` | Date | Lease End Date |

### List Tenants
- **Endpoint:** `GET /tenants`
- **Query Params:** `propertyId` (optional filter), `status`
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "ten_1",
        "name": "Alice Smith",
        "email": "alice@example.com",
        "propertyId": "prop_123",
        "status": "Active",
        "rentAmount": 1500
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

### Get Tenant Details
Includes sub-resources like rent history and maintenance requests.
- **Endpoint:** `GET /tenants/:id`
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "id": "ten_1",
    "name": "Alice Smith",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "phone": "+44 7700 900000",
    "status": "Active",
    "propertyId": "prop_123",
    "unit": "Flat 1",
    "rentAmount": 1500,
    "depositAmount": 1500,
    "leaseStart": "2024-01-01",
    "leaseEnd": "2025-01-01",
    "documents": [
       { "id": "doc_1", "name": "AST Agreement", "type": "AST", "url": "..." }
    ],
    "rentHistory": [
      { "id": 1, "month": "December 2024", "amount": 1500, "status": "Paid", "date": "2024-12-01", "method": "Bank Transfer" }
    ],
    "communications": [
      { "id": 1, "type": "email", "subject": "Welcome", "date": "2024-01-01", "status": "sent" }
    ]
  }
  ```

### Create Tenant
- **Endpoint:** `POST /tenants`
- **Body:**
  ```json
  {
    "name": "Alice Smith",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "propertyId": "prop_123",
    "leaseStart": "2024-01-01",
    "rentAmount": 1500
    // ...
  }
  ```

### Update Tenant
- **Endpoint:** `PUT /tenants/:id`

---

## Maintenance

### Data Model: Maintenance Request
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| [id](file:///Users/vishnu/Workspace/Projects/Xperty/xperty-prototype/src/hooks/useAuth.jsx#5-110) | String | Unique Identifier |
| `title` | String | Short title of the issue |
| `description` | String | Detailed description |
| `priority` | String | Enum: `Low`, `Medium`, `High`, `Emergency` |
| `status` | String | Enum: `Open`, `In Progress`, `Completed`, `Cancelled` |
| `propertyId` | String | ID of the property |
| `tenantId` | String | ID of the tenant (optional) |
| `reportedDate` | Date | Date reported |
| `completedDate` | Date | Date completed (optional) |
| `cost` | Number | Cost of repair (optional) |

### List Maintenance Requests
- **Endpoint:** `GET /maintenance`
- **Query Params:** `propertyId`, `tenantId`, `status`
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "maint_1",
        "title": "Leaking Tap",
        "status": "Open",
        "priority": "Medium",
        "propertyId": "prop_123",
        "reportedDate": "2024-12-01"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

### Create Maintenance Request
- **Endpoint:** `POST /maintenance`
- **Body:**
  ```json
  {
    "title": "Leaking Tap",
    "description": "Kitchen tap is dripping constantly",
    "priority": "Medium",
    "propertyId": "prop_123",
    "tenantId": "ten_1"
  }
  ```

### Update Maintenance Request
- **Endpoint:** `PUT /maintenance/:id`
- **Body:**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "Completed",
    "completedDate": "2024-12-05",
    "cost": 85
  }
  ```

