## Utilities

### Postcode Lookup
Search for addresses by postcode.
- **Endpoint:** `GET /utils/postcode/:postcode`
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "address": "10 Downing Street",
        "city": "London",
        "postcode": "SW1A 1AA",
        "propertyType": "Residential House",
        "bedrooms": 4,
        "bathrooms": 3
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

---

## Assets & Compliance

### Get Asset Library
Returns the static list of available asset categories and items.
- **Endpoint:** `GET /assets/library`
- **Response:** `200 OK`
  ```json
  {
    "heating-cooling": {
      "name": "Heating & Cooling",
      "assets": [
        { "id": "boiler-gas", "name": "Gas Boiler", "compliance": ["gas-safety"] }
      ]
    }
    // ... full library
  }
  ```

## File Uploads

### Upload File
- **Endpoint:** `POST /upload`
- **Body:** `FormData` with file
- **Response:** `201 Created`
  ```json
  {
    "url": "https://storage.xperty.com/uploads/file.pdf",
    "id": "file_123",
    "name": "file.pdf",
    "size": 1024,
    "type": "application/pdf",
    "uploadedAt": "2024-12-04T12:00:00Z"
  }
  ```
